- op: discuss  # 5a48
  at: '2026-03-20T09:25:40Z'  # 5a48
  by: agent  # 5a48
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 5a48
  clock: 2  # 5a48
  nonce: 5a48  # 5a48
  message: "Go IO catalog matches net.Conn.Read/Write against ANY .Read()/.Write() method call regardless of receiver type. age has zero net package imports but 46 network IO chains (15 net_send, 31 net_recv). Root cause: calls to crypto/rand.Reader.Read() and io.Writer.Write() match the catalog entry for net.Conn.Read/Write by method name alone. Fix requires type-aware matching (Tier 2 IO analysis): track receiver types in Go analyzer call edge metadata, then compare against catalog module/type constraints. For now, the false positives inflate chain counts but boundary TYPE classification is correct."  # 5a48
